{"version":1,"content":"<p>新皇崗口岸今日（12日）正式啟用，九巴開辦3條新路線往皇崗口岸。</p><p>截至今早11時，兩條日間路線B10及B11已接載約4500位乘客，九巴表示會視乎需要，在青衣站及大欖隧轉車站加開班次接載乘客。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T04:38:21.733588+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T04:04:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T07:57:40.035547+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"5aadb65a61a8868c896fde67598a648c6273f03632bb417562b3b911fbf323de","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}